{
  "html": "\u003csection style=\"box-sizing: border-box; width: 100%; padding: 18px 16px 24px; background-color: #f6f1e7; border: 3px solid #18181b; color: #18181b; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \u0026#39;PingFang SC\u0026#39;, \u0026#39;Microsoft YaHei\u0026#39;, sans-serif; overflow-wrap: anywhere\" data-no-dark=\"\" id=\"cw-layout-imported\"\u003e\u003csection style=\"display: table; width: 100%; height: 10px; margin: 0 0 16px; border: 2px solid #18181b\" data-no-dark=\"\"\u003e\u003csection style=\"display: table-cell; width: 42%; background-color: #d63628\" data-no-dark=\"\"\u003e\u003c/section\u003e\u003csection style=\"display: table-cell; width: 33%; background-color: #1e4fa3\" data-no-dark=\"\"\u003e\u003c/section\u003e\u003csection style=\"display: table-cell; width: 25%; background-color: #f4c531\" data-no-dark=\"\"\u003e\u003c/section\u003e\u003c/section\u003e\u003csection data-no-dark=\"\"\u003e\u003csection style=\"margin: 0 0 18px; padding: 13px 15px; background-color: #ffffff; border: 2px solid #18181b; box-shadow: 4px 4px 0 #1e4fa3\" data-no-dark=\"\"\u003e\u003cp style=\"color: #18181b; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \u0026#39;PingFang SC\u0026#39;, \u0026#39;Microsoft YaHei\u0026#39;, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; line-height: 1.85; margin: 0\"\u003e红、黄、蓝与硬朗黑线正面碰撞，不用任何多余修饰，单靠几何比例就能一秒锁住视线。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/section\u003e\u003csection style=\"margin: 22px 0 0\" data-no-dark=\"\"\u003e\u003csection style=\"margin: 0 0 14px; display: table; width: 100%; table-layout: fixed; border: 2px solid #18181b; box-shadow: 4px 4px 0 #18181b; background-color: #d63628\" data-no-dark=\"\"\u003e\u003csection style=\"display: table-cell; width: 54px; background-color: #f4c531; color: #18181b; text-align: center; vertical-align: middle; border-right: 2px solid #18181b; font-family: Menlo, Consolas, \u0026#39;PingFang SC\u0026#39;, monospace; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; padding: 9px 0\" data-no-dark=\"\"\u003e01\u003c/section\u003e\u003ch2 style=\"display: table-cell; vertical-align: middle; margin: 0; padding: 9px 14px; font-size: 17px; font-weight: 700; color: #ffffff; letter-spacing: 0.5px\" data-no-dark=\"\"\u003e让结构本身成为画面的主角\u003c/h2\u003e\u003c/section\u003e\u003csection data-no-dark=\"\"\u003e\u003csection data-no-dark=\"\"\u003e\u003cp style=\"color: #18181b; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \u0026#39;PingFang SC\u0026#39;, \u0026#39;Microsoft YaHei\u0026#39;, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.85; margin: 0 0 14px\"\u003e章节头支持\u003cstrong style=\"color: #d63628; font-weight: 700\"\u003e红、蓝、黑三色自动循环切换\u003c/strong\u003e，搭配明黄硬阴影金句块，节奏明快张扬。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/section\u003e\u003csection style=\"margin: 18px 0; padding: 14px 16px; background-color: #f4c531; border: 2px solid #18181b; box-shadow: 4px 4px 0 #18181b\" data-no-dark=\"\"\u003e\u003cblockquote style=\"border: 0; margin: 0; padding: 0\"\u003e\u003cp style=\"color: #18181b; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \u0026#39;PingFang SC\u0026#39;, \u0026#39;Microsoft YaHei\u0026#39;, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 700; line-height: 1.8; margin: 0\"\u003e大胆的形式不是噱头，而是鲜明态度的直接表达。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/blockquote\u003e\u003c/section\u003e\u003csection style=\"margin: 18px 0; padding: 6px; background-color: #ffffff; border: 2px solid #18181b; box-shadow: 4px 4px 0 #d63628\" data-no-dark=\"\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https://api.gitcode.com/api/v5/repos/wendao-ai/wendao-ai-template-market/raw/sample-images/minimal-architecture.jpg\" alt=\"包豪斯风格几何建筑光影\" style=\"display: block; height: auto; margin: 0; max-width: 100%; width: 100%\"/\u003e\u003c/section\u003e\u003c/section\u003e\u003c/section\u003e\u003csection style=\"margin: 22px 0 0\" data-no-dark=\"\"\u003e\u003csection style=\"margin: 0 0 14px; display: table; width: 100%; table-layout: fixed; border: 2px solid #18181b; box-shadow: 4px 4px 0 #18181b; background-color: #1e4fa3\" data-no-dark=\"\"\u003e\u003csection style=\"display: table-cell; width: 54px; background-color: #18181b; color: #ffffff; text-align: center; vertical-align: middle; border-right: 2px solid #18181b; font-family: Menlo, Consolas, \u0026#39;PingFang SC\u0026#39;, monospace; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; padding: 9px 0\" data-no-dark=\"\"\u003e02\u003c/section\u003e\u003ch2 style=\"display: table-cell; vertical-align: middle; margin: 0; padding: 9px 14px; font-size: 17px; font-weight: 700; color: #ffffff; letter-spacing: 0.5px\" data-no-dark=\"\"\u003e三色交替带来的节奏变化\u003c/h2\u003e\u003c/section\u003e\u003csection data-no-dark=\"\"\u003e\u003csection style=\"margin: 14px 0; padding: 12px 14px; background-color: #ffffff; border: 2px solid #18181b\" data-no-dark=\"\"\u003e\u003cul style=\"color: #18181b; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.85; margin: 0; padding-left: 20px\"\u003e\u003cli style=\"margin: 0 0 6px\"\u003e第 1/2/3 章自动切换红蓝黑色块\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli style=\"margin: 0 0 6px\"\u003e硬黑框偏移投影呈现波普张力\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli style=\"margin: 0 0 6px\"\u003e高对比色盘在手机屏极度醒目\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003c/section\u003e\u003csection style=\"margin: 16px 0\" data-no-dark=\"\"\u003e\u003ctable style=\"border: 2px solid #18181b; border-collapse: collapse; color: #18181b; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.7; table-layout: fixed; width: 100%\"\u003e\u003cthead\u003e\u003ctr\u003e\u003cth style=\"background-color: #18181b; border: 2px solid #18181b; color: #f4c531; font-weight: 700; padding: 8px 10px; text-align: left\"\u003e维度\u003c/th\u003e\u003cth style=\"background-color: #18181b; border: 2px solid #18181b; color: #f4c531; font-weight: 700; padding: 8px 10px; text-align: left\"\u003e版式表现\u003c/th\u003e\u003c/tr\u003e\u003c/thead\u003e\u003ctbody\u003e\u003ctr\u003e\u003ctd style=\"background-color: #ffffff; border: 1px solid #18181b; color: #18181b; padding: 8px 10px\"\u003e章节机制\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd style=\"background-color: #ffffff; border: 1px solid #18181b; color: #18181b; padding: 8px 10px\"\u003e3 套造型自动循环\u003c/td\u003e\u003c/tr\u003e\u003ctr\u003e\u003ctd style=\"background-color: #ffffff; border: 1px solid #18181b; color: #18181b; padding: 8px 10px\"\u003e视觉语言\u003c/td\u003e\u003ctd style=\"background-color: #ffffff; border: 1px solid #18181b; color: #18181b; padding: 8px 10px\"\u003e红黄蓝原色 + 4px 硬投影\u003c/td\u003e\u003c/tr\u003e\u003c/tbody\u003e\u003c/table\u003e\u003c/section\u003e\u003c/section\u003e\u003c/section\u003e\u003csection style=\"margin: 22px 0 0\" data-no-dark=\"\"\u003e\u003csection style=\"margin: 0 0 14px; display: table; width: 100%; table-layout: fixed; border: 2px solid #18181b; box-shadow: 4px 4px 0 #18181b; background-color: #18181b\" data-no-dark=\"\"\u003e\u003csection style=\"display: table-cell; width: 54px; background-color: #d63628; color: #ffffff; text-align: center; vertical-align: middle; border-right: 2px solid #18181b; font-family: Menlo, Consolas, \u0026#39;PingFang SC\u0026#39;, monospace; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; padding: 9px 0\" data-no-dark=\"\"\u003e03\u003c/section\u003e\u003ch2 style=\"display: table-cell; vertical-align: middle; margin: 0; padding: 9px 14px; font-size: 17px; font-weight: 700; color: #ffffff; letter-spacing: 0.5px\" data-no-dark=\"\"\u003e打破单调的第三拍\u003c/h2\u003e\u003c/section\u003e\u003csection data-no-dark=\"\"\u003e\u003csection data-no-dark=\"\"\u003e\u003cp style=\"color: #18181b; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \u0026#39;PingFang SC\u0026#39;, \u0026#39;Microsoft YaHei\u0026#39;, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.85; margin: 0 0 14px\"\u003e当文章进入第三章节，深黑底配朱红序号块自动接棒，整篇节奏层层推进。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/section\u003e\u003csection style=\"margin: 22px 0 0; padding: 12px 14px; background-color: #18181b; color: #ffffff; border: 2px solid #18181b\" data-no-dark=\"\"\u003e\u003cp style=\"color: #f6f1e7; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \u0026#39;PingFang SC\u0026#39;, \u0026#39;Microsoft YaHei\u0026#39;, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 600; line-height: 1.8; margin: 0\"\u003e做有态度的内容，就要配一套过目不忘的版式语言。\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/section\u003e\u003c/section\u003e\u003c/section\u003e\u003c/section\u003e\u003c/section\u003e",
